ne of the watch's own zone bands, not the range we\n./readback/watch-notes.md:19:zone edges, never 151–160 or 129–141. Earlier tries: `units: \"bpm\"` with\n./readback/watch-notes.md:20:absolute values made the watch show 214–249 bpm; `start_bpm`/`end_bpm` made\n./readback/watch-notes.md:21:every target a constant 101.\n./README.md:7:  `POST /api/v1/athlete/{id}/events` (an event with `workout_doc`).\n./README.md:12:Athlete thresholds live in Intervals (LTHR 172 for this athlete). HR targets\n./README.md:13:in plans are percentages of LTHR; Intervals converts them to bpm at export.\n./gen.py:2:\"\"\"Build an Intervals.icu event body (workout_doc) from a plan file.\n./gen.py:10:def hr_target(step):\n./gen.py:13:    return {\"units\": \"%lthr\", \"value\": lo, \"end\": hi}\n./gen.py:19:        out[\"hr\"] = hr_target(step)\n./gen.py:44:        \"workout_doc\": build_doc(plan),\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
